### Test Role and Permission Management Endpoints

# Note: These endpoints require authentication and proper authorization
# The responses will be 401 Unauthorized without proper authentication

### Get All Roles
GET http://localhost:5000/api/roles
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Role by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/roles/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Get All Permissions
GET http://localhost:5000/api/permissions
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Permission Categories
GET http://localhost:5000/api/permissions/categories
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Permission by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/permissions/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Permissions by Role
GET http://localhost:5000/api/permissions/roles/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Update Permission
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/permissions/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ProductsViewUpdated",
  "description": "Updated description for viewing products",
  "descriptionFa": "توضیحات به روز شده برای مشاهده محصولات",
  "category": "Products",
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Create New Permission
POST http://localhost:5000/api/permissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "CustomPermissionTest",
  "description": "A new custom permission for testing validation",
  "descriptionFa": "مجوز سفارشی جدید برای تست اعتبارسنجی",
  "category": "Testing"
}

###

### Create Permission with Missing Category (Should fail validation)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/permissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "TestPermissionNoCategory",
  "description": "This should fail due to missing category",
  "descriptionFa": "این باید به دلیل عدم وجود دسته‌بندی ناکام باشد"
}

###

### Create Permission with Empty Name (Should fail validation)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/permissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "description": "This should fail due to empty name",
  "descriptionFa": "این باید به دلیل نام خالی ناکام باشد",
  "category": "Testing"
}

###
